{"detail": {"templateUuid": "f4f2a125920c47d1965db5394114732f", "projectUuid": "2982d622a8974566bdc7690b020224e2", "name": "Lost Gu Visage咒黎面具", "description": "公元2035年，考古队在公元前五千年的地层中发现了一个不属于任何已知文明的遗迹。随之而来的，是一场被称为“大异变”的灾难。少年查尔斯失去了父母，独自带着父亲留下的机械犬AshPup，在荒芜的世界中存活了四百多天。母亲临终前的遗言只有一句——“永远别碰那个面具。“每隔一个月，他必须前往补给站清除“麻烦”，收集生存物资。他不知道这样的日子还能撑多久。而在遥远的海岸线上，多方势力察觉到了即将现世的咒黎面具，多方势力共同的目标只有一个—带回那个孩子/抢夺那个面具。因为失落的面具，即将再次现世。", "coverUrl": "/assets/7ff4cacb08ca1029.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/63ace3a121d741e8af17355f9ef4a79c/0ad43f98bd821c5da0e945ee9d55e365da22a160.mp4", "snapshotId": 22786, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 587519, "ownerUuid": "63ace3a121d741e8af17355f9ef4a79c", "avatar": "/assets/358d4ca7b6641133.webp", "nickname": "ZERO", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 20, "tags": [{"id": 1803, "code": "virtual_human", "tagLabel": "仿真人", "parentTag": 1800, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1800/1803/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年06月29日 16:59", "updateAt": "2026年07月02日 23:25", "publishAt": "2026年06月29日 16:59", "playCount": 3, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/f4f2a125920c47d1965db5394114732f.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 103, "edges": 55}}, "recommendList": []}